  "kissed-in-silence": {"prompt":"Exact identity reference for the character from the reference image. Preserve the character’s facial identity, facial structure, head shape, hairstyle or baldness, facial hair if present, age, skin tone, body proportions, and all distinctive visual traits visible in the reference image. Do not replace, beautify, or reinterpret the character. The generated person must clearly look like the same character from the reference\n\nCreate a direct, medium close-up portrait of this exact character seated alone on a black couch, wearing a white cotton button-up shirt with an open collar.\n\nThe character’s skin is smooth and slightly flushed, adorned with several vibrant red lipstick kiss marks scattered naturally across the cheeks, jawline, chin, and neck. The lipstick marks should look realistic, vivid, and slightly irregular, like real transferred lipstick.\n\nThe character’s posture is relaxed and nonchalant. Their eyes are closed, conveying a calm, self-assured, almost indifferent attitude. Their hands rest naturally and loosely in their lap.\n\nThe background is a simple, pristine white wall, with the lower part of the image showing the couch upholstery. The composition should feel high-contrast, minimal, and clean.\n\nThe lighting is harsh and direct, as if from a single on-camera flash, creating sharp, well-defined shadows and strong highlights on the skin and clothing. The image should have a modern digital-camera look: ultra-sharp details, realistic skin texture, minimal noise.\n\nThe color palette is predominantly monochromatic, dominated by white, black, and natural skin tones, with the saturated red lipstick marks serving as the main accent color.\n\nThe character is completely alone in the frame. No second person is visible. No female hand, no extra hand, no hand touching the face, neck, beard, or head. Only the character’s own two hands are visible, resting in their lap.\n\nProvocative, edgy, fashion-forward mood with a rebellious undertone.","promptSha256":"6332baff20e40c6da0a084792aa937e91064920fc967dad893407afd8df2a987","sourcePromptAvailable":true,"sourceAuditStatus":"verified-2026-11-13","sourceRecordId":"01a097db-b9d7-7190-ae74-c03ee5492f1f","sourceMediaId":"rbPkJabmiMsK0QVieqUrtvsPuHVcr6FByduyaRpi","sourceTitle":"Kissed in Silence","sourceSlug":"kissed-in-silence","sourceModel":"seedream-5.0-pro","sourceModelFamily":"seedream","sourceAspect":"3:4","sourceMinFiles":1,"sourceGenerationSettings":{"stream":false,"model_type":"seedream-5.0-pro","resolution":"2K","aspect_ratio":"3:4"}},
  "midnight-fuel-stop": {"prompt":"Preserve the exact facial identity of the person from the reference photo: face shape, jawline, nose, mouth, head shape, hairstyle, facial hair, skin tone. No distortion, no stylization.\n\nCandid flash-lit night photo at a gas station, raw paparazzi / underground fashion snapshot, 35mm, slightly imperfect framing. Medium shot, waist up, the person slightly left of center, facing camera.\n\nThey are frozen mid-bite into a doner kebab, holding it with both hands, a bit of sauce smeared on the wrapper and lip. Heavy oversized black fur coat, dark Oakley sunglasses at night, calm detached expression — casual, unapologetic, real.\n\nBehind them, at the pump where a car would be, a modern military fighter jet is parked as if refueling: recognizable silhouette, matte grey fuselage, dim red and white navigation lights.\n\nLight: direct on-camera flash is the main source — bright highlights on the face, fur, metal, and food, hard shadow falling behind. Ambient is the real gas station mix: warm white fluorescent light under the canopy, a faint orange sodium glow from the street, pump screens and price signs slightly overexposed. Neutral white balance, natural skin tones, no blue cast.\n\nLight film grain, slight motion blur on the hands, candid snapshot feel. Realistic photo, not cinematic.","promptSha256":"998d688a64cc2b49c6b97c3f9084c3696e4c9e65d223eb311f3b1f63c87616da","sourcePromptAvailable":true,"sourceAuditStatus":"verified-2026-11-13","sourceRecordId":"01a097bd-a629-71a3-ab92-ea4e242b374f","sourceMediaId":"uDsdhowMSXPMuTizC9CONwwus0n07hsLCmpWchie","sourceTitle":"Midnight Fuel Stop","sourceSlug":"midnight-fuel-stop","sourceModel":"banana3","sourceModelFamily":"banana","sourceAspect":"3:4","sourceMinFiles":1,"sourceGenerationSettings":{"n":1,"image_size":"2K","model_type":"banana3","aspect_ratio":"3:4"}},
  "black-horsepower": {"prompt":"Preserve the exact facial identity of the person from the reference photo: face, head shape, hairstyle, facial hair, age, skin tone.\n\nCinematic editorial photoshoot, medium format look, 85mm lens, camera at waist height with a slight upward tilt, shallow depth of field. Vertical 3:4 frame. Anamorphic feel, subtle horizontal lens flare.\n\nLayout: the person stands slightly right of center, full body visible, feet near the bottom edge, head in the upper quarter. A black Porsche 911 GT3 RS fills the left half, parked in profile, front facing left, driver's door directly behind the person; carbon fiber hood and large rear wing visible. A black Friesian horse stands in the right third, body in profile facing left, head turned toward camera, its shoulder level with the person's shoulder.\n\nPose: the person leans with their right shoulder and hip against the car door, weight on the right leg, left leg crossed at the ankle. Right hand in jacket pocket. Left hand holds a leather lead rope at hip height, running to the horse's halter. Head straight, chin slightly lowered, eyes into the lens, calm intense expression, mouth closed.\n\nWardrobe: fitted black leather jacket zipped halfway, plain dark grey t-shirt, dark indigo denim, black boots.\n\nSetting: nocturnal stone courtyard. Behind the subjects, a pale stucco wall with one stone archway and dark wood double door centered behind the horse, wet cobblestone ground reflecting light. Thin haze in the air. Black sky above the wall.\n\nLight: key light from a large softbox front-left at 45°, soft but directional, sculpting the face. Warm tungsten rim light from behind right, edging the person's jaw and shoulder, the horse's mane, and the car's roofline. Cool teal fill spilling from the archway. Face sharply focused, background softly falling off.\n\nGrade: teal-and-orange cinematic color grade, deep blacks with lifted shadows, fine film grain, soft halation on highlights, slight vignette. High-end automotive fashion campaign, Vogue Hommes meets film still.","promptSha256":"e87a585bab1e7d9da244944ca7a267b7e8326a8ca2694811aa36dd5a80b68113","sourcePromptAvailable":true,"sourceAuditStatus":"verified-2026-11-13","sourceRecordId":"01a097bb-fecd-73be-952a-aee9d00ef1ba","sourceMediaId":"GhCIv7M9RkPTPH7xobN8sOR5X4hEamWeh5Vfoogk","sourceTitle":"Black Horsepower","sourceSlug":"black-horsepower","sourceModel":"banana3","sourceModelFamily":"banana","sourceAspect":"3:4","sourceMinFiles":1,"sourceGenerationSettings":{"n":1,"image_size":"2K","model_type":"banana3","aspect_ratio":"3:4"}},
